# Third-party licenses

This file lists the third-party crates that tpt-simd depends on, grouped by
license. It is generated; do not edit it by hand. Regenerate it with:

```sh
cargo about generate about.hbs -o THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md
```

Only licenses listed in `about.toml` are accepted. Dev-dependencies are not
included because they are not distributed with the crates.

